-- THEOREM 1: CONSTANT-PRODUCT INVARIANT (k1 >= k0), POSITIVE SURPLUS EXTRACTION ON IMBALANCED
-- POOLS, AND ZERO-LOSS ATOMIC REVERT ON BALANCED POOLS BY `refl`!
